{"messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "Write a Caesar cipher encrypt function."}, {"role": "silicat", "content": "```python\ndef caesar(text, shift):\n    result = []\n    for c in text:\n        if c.isalpha():\n            base = ord(\"A\") if c.isupper() else ord(\"a\")\n            result.append(chr((ord(c) - base + shift) % 26 + base))\n        else:\n            result.append(c)\n    return \"\".join(result)\n```"}]}
