{"messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "Write a function to split a big file into smaller files of N lines each."}, {"role": "silicat", "content": "```python\ndef split_file(path, lines_per_file=1000):\n    with open(path, encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n        chunk = []\n        index = 0\n        for line in f:\n            chunk.append(line)\n            if len(chunk) >= lines_per_file:\n                with open(f\"{path}.part{index}\", \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as out:\n                    out.writelines(chunk)\n                chunk = []\n                index += 1\n        if chunk:\n            with open(f\"{path}.part{index}\", \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as out:\n                out.writelines(chunk)\n```"}]}
