{"messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "Write a function to compute Levenshtein distance between two strings."}, {"role": "silicat", "content": "```python\ndef levenshtein(a, b):\n    if len(a) < len(b):\n        a, b = b, a\n    prev = list(range(len(b) + 1))\n    for i, ca in enumerate(a, 1):\n        cur = [i]\n        for j, cb in enumerate(b, 1):\n            cur.append(min(prev[j] + 1, cur[j - 1] + 1, prev[j - 1] + (ca != cb)))\n        prev = cur\n    return prev[-1]\n```"}]}
